' Example usage
note bottom of XNNPACKQuantizer
  **Example Usage:**
  
  quantizer = XNNPACKQuantizer()
  quantizer.set_global(
    QuantizationConfig(
      activation=QuantizationSpec(
        dtype="int8",
        qscheme=QScheme.PER_TENSOR_SYMMETRIC
      ),
      weight=QuantizationSpec(
        dtype="int8",
        qscheme=QScheme.PER_CHANNEL_SYMMETRIC
      )
    )
  )
  
  prepared = prepare_pt2e(model, quantizer)
  # ... calibration ...
  quantized = convert_pt2e(prepared)
end note

legend right
  |= Component |= Description |
  | QuantizationSpec | Defines quantization parameters |
  | QConfig | Layer-specific config |
  | Observer | Collects activation statistics |
  | FakeQuantize | Simulates quantization |
  | XNNPACKQuantizer | Orchestrates quantization |
  
  **Quantization Schemes:**
  • Per-tensor: single scale/zp for entire tensor
  • Per-channel: separate scale/zp per channel
  • Microscaling: block-based quantization
  • Group-wise: quantize in groups
endlegend

@enduml
